Subject: [PATCH 1/5] feat(projects): replace Notes App with MARS-X

MARS-X (NASA Space Apps 2026, Martian exploration console) is a far
stronger card than the notes app it replaces: live demo, real screenshot
from the repo, and a stack that shows geospatial + full-stack work.

- data: mars-x entry with copy taken from the repo README, live link
  mars-x-nasa.vercel.app, category "Geospatial"
- public/projects: real console screenshot at 1200x675, quantised to
  300 KB; notesapp.png removed since nothing references it
