Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 10:04:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] feat(projects): swap Advanced Calculator for IBVAP and
 refresh card art

IBVAP (Intelligent Border Video Analytics Platform, Smart India
Hackathon) replaces the calculator: YOLO detection with ByteTrack
tracking, YuNet/SFace recognition, an incident engine with threat
scoring and evidence capture, React console over REST and WebSockets.
Copy is taken from the repo's architecture doc; the card credits the
contribution to the command-centre UI.

- data: ibvap entry pointing at github.com/iamasifroshan/IBVAP
- public/projects/ibvap.png: their satellite border map with a
  typographic cover, since the repo has no UI screenshots
- public/projects/mars-x.png: replaced the terrain heatmap with the
  Terrain Intelligence console view, which shows the actual product UI
