Subject: [PATCH 3/5] feat(portfolio): reorder projects, add Notes App APK,
 contact sheet, ambient backdrop

- projects: order is now bloodlink, skillsync, foodbridge, tikizaya,
  salary-payroll, ibvap, mars-x, bizgenie-ai, ridegram, zayathon, then
  notesapp
- notesapp: back in the grid with an APK download pointing at the v1.0
  release asset (11 MB, linked rather than committed) and a cover built
  from the app's own launcher icon
- Project gains an optional `apk` field: an APK link on the card and a
  "Download APK" button in the modal
- contact: the visible email and phone cards are replaced by one
  "Contact me" box that opens a sheet with email, call, GitHub and
  LinkedIn
- layout/styles: fixed aurora backdrop (warm and violet gradients plus a
  faint grid, disabled under prefers-reduced-motion), warmer card
  surfaces and a gold gradient primary button
