From: Muhammad Afrith D <204439824+dev-afrith@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 10:31:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] feat(contact): show details by default, validate the
 form, richer backdrop
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- contact: email, phone, GitHub and LinkedIn are visible again as icon
  cards; the click-to-open sheet is gone
- form: adds an optional mobile field and validates before sending —
  name length, strict email format, Indian mobile format (10 digits
  starting 6-9, optional +91 or 0), subject and message length. Invalid
  fields get a red state, an inline message, aria-invalid and focus on
  the first error. The form uses noValidate so these messages win over
  the browser's
- backdrop: topographic contour rings and a dot matrix layered over the
  aurora and grid so the page is no longer flat black
---
