- form: submitting flags only the first invalid field, focuses it and
  shows its message. Fixing it and submitting again surfaces the next
  one, so five red fields never appear at once
- contact cards: labels are gone, only the value shows — the email, the
  number, dev-afrith and Muhammad Afrith
- the phone card is now a button: tapping it reveals Call (tel:) and
  Mobile (sms:) actions, closing on outside click or Escape. The hrefs
  strip spaces so the dialer receives a clean number
